Day 04 – Docker Revision & Practice

Overview

Today, I focused on revising the Docker concepts and commands covered in the previous sessions.

Revision Topics

- Docker Images and Containers
- Container lifecycle: Create, Start, Stop, and Remove
- Running an Nginx container
- Checking running and stopped containers
- Viewing container logs using "docker logs"
- Accessing a container using "docker exec"
- Exploring the Nginx default website directory
- Inspecting container configuration using "docker inspect"

Learning Outcome

Revised the fundamentals of Docker image and container management, along with practical commands used to inspect and manage containers.

Note: Today's session was focused on revision rather than introducing new topics.
